		<meta name="description" content="In this episode, SBAI’s Brian Digney is joined by Chantal Berendsen, Partner and Senior Hedge Fund IDD Analyst at Albourne Partners (an independently owned, non-discretionary, global investment consultant specialising in alternatives assets), and Richard Lowther Managing Partner and Co-Founder of Integral ILS (an independent alternative investment manager, focused on natural catastrophe (re)insurance), to explore the fascinating world of insurance-linked securities (ILS)." />
	

	

	
